    <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "0a1e4b88-e9de-4c52-b803-e237bc73acdb",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-57357-story\">\n<section class=\"c57357-intro\" aria-labelledby=\"c57357-intro-title\">\n    <p class=\"c57357-kicker\">World Humanitarian Day</p>\n    <h2 class=\"c57357-intro__title\" id=\"c57357-intro-title\">\n      When Compassion Becomes <span>Collective Action</span>\n    </h2>\n    <p class=\"c57357-intro__copy\">\n      World Humanitarian Day is an opportunity to recognize the power of compassion, shared responsibility, and support for organizations creating lasting impact within their communities.\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"c57357-intro__copy\">\n      Centro marked the occasion with a visit to Children’s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357, bringing our people together in support of one of Egypt’s most recognized community-powered healthcare institutions.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"c57357-intro__tags\" aria-label=\"Article highlights\">\n      <span class=\"c57357-intro__tag\">Hospital 57357</span>\n      <span class=\"c57357-intro__tag\">Community Support</span>\n      <span class=\"c57357-intro__tag\">Centroees Giving Together</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "f6cf8168-6576-4a1a-afb0-df3ecaaa880a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-57357-story\">\n<section class=\"c57357-giving\" aria-labelledby=\"c57357-giving-title\">\n    <p class=\"c57357-kicker\">Giving in Action</p>\n    <h2 class=\"c57357-section-title\" id=\"c57357-giving-title\">A Shared Contribution from Centro and Our Centroees</h2>\n    <p class=\"c57357-section-copy\">\n      The initiative brought together Centro’s corporate support and the generosity of our Centroees, creating one collective contribution in support of Hospital 57357.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"c57357-giving__grid\">\n      <article class=\"c57357-card\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M4 10.5h16v9H4z\" />\n            <path d=\"M3 10.5 12 4l9 6.5M8 19.5v-5h8v5\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        <h3>Corporate Support</h3>\n        <p>Centro made a corporate donation in support of the hospital’s ongoing mission and the communities it serves.</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"c57357-card\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M12 20.5S4.5 16.2 4.5 9.8A4.3 4.3 0 0 1 12 6.9a4.3 4.3 0 0 1 7.5 2.9C19.5 16.2 12 20.5 12 20.5Z\" />\n            <path d=\"M12 6.9V3.5M9.5 4.8 12 3.5l2.5 1.3\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        <h3>Centroee Contributions</h3>\n        <p>Personal donations from our people became part of Centro’s accumulated contribution to Hospital 57357.</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"c57357-card\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M5 9h14v11H5zM3.5 9h17\" />\n            <path d=\"M12 9v11M7.5 6.5C7.5 4.6 9.7 4 12 9c2.3-5 4.5-4.4 4.5-2.5 0 1.5-1.5 2.5-4.5 2.5-3 0-4.5-1-4.5-2.5Z\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        <h3>Moments of Encouragement</h3>\n        <p>Our team brought toys for the children, adding a thoughtful and personal gesture to the visit.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <a class=\"c57357-video\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7497632157146996736\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Watch Centro’s visit to Children’s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357 on LinkedIn\">\n      <span class=\"c57357-video__copy\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-video__label\">Centro at Hospital 57357</span>\n        <h3>Watch the Visit</h3>\n        <p>See the moments that brought our Centroees together in support of Hospital 57357.</p>\n        <span class=\"c57357-video__cta\">\n          Watch on LinkedIn\n          <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"c57357-video__visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://centrocdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/57-BLOG-3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <span class=\"c57357-video__play\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M8.2 5.8v12.4L18 12 8.2 5.8Z\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "db4db173-42f9-4ce5-a568-28828fc37790",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-57357-story\">\n<section class=\"c57357-path\" aria-labelledby=\"c57357-path-title\">\n    <p class=\"c57357-kicker\">The Importance of Collective Action</p>\n    <h2 class=\"c57357-section-title\" id=\"c57357-path-title\">Impact Grows When People Participate Together</h2>\n    <p class=\"c57357-section-copy\">\n      Hospital 57357 reflects what can be achieved when individuals, organizations, and communities come together around a shared purpose. Corporate contributions, employee participation, and greater awareness can each strengthen that effort.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"c57357-path__steps\">\n      <article class=\"c57357-step\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-step__number\">01</span>\n        <h3>Build Awareness</h3>\n        <p>Bring attention to organizations creating meaningful community impact.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"c57357-step\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-step__number\">02</span>\n        <h3>Encourage Participation</h3>\n        <p>Create opportunities for people and businesses to contribute together.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"c57357-step\">\n        <span class=\"c57357-step__number\">03</span>\n        <h3>Sustain Support</h3>\n        <p>Turn individual actions into a wider and more lasting collective effort.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "e7e4ea3c-7e2e-4923-a0eb-3dc9f988e493",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-57357-story\">\n<section class=\"c57357-impact\" aria-labelledby=\"c57357-impact-title\">\n    <span class=\"c57357-impact__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <path d=\"M12 21S4 16.5 4 9.7A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 6.9a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8 2.8C20 16.5 12 21 12 21Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M9 12h6M12 9v6\" />\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n    <div>\n      <h2 id=\"c57357-impact-title\">Continuing to Make an Impact</h2>\n      <p>\n        Meaningful change is rarely created by one contribution alone. It becomes stronger when individuals, businesses, and communities choose to participate together. Centro remains committed to supporting initiatives that create value for the communities around us and encourage our people to take part in making a positive difference.\n      </p>\n      <span class=\"c57357-impact__thanks\">Thank you to every Centroee who contributed</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "3e3e4768-2abc-4cbd-a544-702b6c3c444b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "About Hospital 57357"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "about-57357"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "2ec3e34e-e9c0-4bb1-bf5f-fe7248e228cd",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-57357-story\"><p class=\"c57357-section-copy\">Children’s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357 was established in 2007 with a mission focused on combating childhood cancer through quality care, research, and education while providing treatment to children free of charge.</p></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "29b3903f-1874-4d56-8fc4-4f0c36d2bfb4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Built Through Community Support"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The hospital was built through donations, demonstrating the impact individuals, organizations, and communities can create when they come together behind a shared purpose."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "fb905988-5540-4d15-9d00-937781932050",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Specialized Pediatric Oncology Care"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Hospital 57357 provides specialized care for children while working to ensure that access to treatment is not determined by a family’s financial circumstances."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "788c90a3-388d-4ece-b320-082d5ed1247b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Research and Education"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Research and education form an important part of the hospital’s mission, supporting the continued development of knowledge and care in pediatric oncology."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "4d1d9b9d-870e-42a8-9176-bc6a4014db35",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Support Beyond Treatment"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The hospital’s approach also includes rehabilitation, psychological support, social support, and services designed to help children and their families throughout the care journey."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000008",
      "key": "dba99fb5-91f9-4bab-b829-6614af9858cc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "eyebrow",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "About Centro"
        },
        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "People, Performance, and Meaningful Impact"
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p>Centro is a global BPO and technology services provider supporting organizations through Contact Center Outsourcing, healthcare operations, and digital transformation. Across our global delivery network, we combine operational expertise with a people-first culture that encourages professional growth, community engagement, and real-world results.</p><div class=\"c57357-centro__services\" aria-label=\"Centro areas of expertise\"><span>Contact Center Outsourcing</span><span>Healthcare Operations</span><span>Digital Transformation</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLabel",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Learn More About Centro"
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLink",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[{\"name\":\"Learn More About Centro\",\"url\":\"https://centrocdx.com/about\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"queryString\":null}]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
